@startuml lesson-gates
' purpose: how lesson gates, timers, and board geometry advance lessons
' covers: apps/starchess/src/tutorial/tutorialScript.config.ts
' covers: apps/starchess/src/screens/TutorialScreen.tsx
' covers: apps/starchess/src/__tests__/tutorialScript.test.ts
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

title StarChess · Tutorial lesson gates and geometry

component "fog catalog\n8 stories" as Fog <<db>>
component "specials catalog\n6 stories" as Specials <<db>>
component "resolve catalog\n2 replays" as Resolve <<db>>
component "king catalog\n9 live boards" as King <<db>>
component "matchesCompleteWhen\ngate evaluator" as Gates <<app>>
component "TutorialScreen outcome\nactive ending success failed" as Outcome <<app>>
component "adjutant opponent\nlive reply" as Adjutant <<async>>
component "planning timer\nking lessons armed" as Timer <<async>>

Fog ARROW_MAIN Gates : seed must not match
Specials ARROW_MAIN Gates : seed must not match
King ARROW_MAIN Gates : seed must not match
Resolve ARROW_OPTIONAL Gates : typewriter + elapsed
Gates ARROW_MAIN Outcome : complete or restart
Adjutant ARROW_QUEUE Gates : reply moves the wire
Timer ARROW_OPTIONAL Outcome : clock pressure only
Outcome ARROW_ERROR Gates : failed remounts seed

note as M1
No gate may match its seed, or lessons end
before they start; SCFEN, queue, typewriter,
and elapsed cover every stage. Hints keep
one step whose rings and lines draw as one,
above fog, with no legality checks at all.
end note
M1 .. Gates

note as M2
Fog hands positions forward and siege wins
at one pawn, keeping the tank while killing
one mark per turn. Marine and hoverbike run
four beats across two turns, specific first,
and off-script orders still coach aloud.
end note
M2 .. Specials

note as M3
Defense races pin gates to engine resolve,
where gas lands before attacks and paired
movers trade. The loss line holds the bubble
while restart counts down, so players read
why before the retry lands at all.
end note
M3 .. King

note as M4
Attack one clears the b7 choke so rank and
diagonal checkers meet, with mines never
blocking the x-ray. Two checkers stack the
kill while one alone invites the tank
counter that shoots the ship for retry.
end note
M4 .. King

note as M5
Attack two sails a lone hull the adjutant
punishes when still, with jumps budgeted
each tier-three turn. Every king lesson
arms its timer and every closing line earns
bounded reading time before handoff.
end note
M5 .. Outcome

' --- IGNORE: layout hints (do not edit) ---
Fog -[hidden]- Specials
Specials -[hidden]- Resolve
Resolve -[hidden]- King
' --- END IGNORE ---
@enduml
